          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abafilisitiya bongera kuzamuka ubwa kabiri, badendeza mu kibaya cy'Abarafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bwo Dawidi agisha Uwiteka inama, aramusubiza ati “Nturi buzamuke ahubwo ubace ikubo, ubarasukireho ahateganye n'ishyamba ry'imitugunguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko niwumva ikiriri cy'ingabo gihindira hejuru y'imitugunguru, uhereko uhutireho kuko ubwo Uwiteka ari bube akugiye imbere, gutsinda ingabo z'Abafilisitiya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi abigenza atyo nk'uko Uwiteka amutegetse, atsinda Abafilisitiya uhereye i Geba ukageza i Gezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
